%% The monthly attendance and leave consolidation (area 3's design; the screens exist on sample data).
sequenceDiagram
  actor HR as HR, Singapore
  participant API as Area 3: consolidation service
  participant Job as BullMQ: consolidation job
  participant C as Area 1: SG HR and CN HQ adapters
  participant R as Category mappers and validators
  participant FM as Area 1: FieldMasker

  HR->>API: POST /attendance-leave/runs (month, entities)
  API->>Job: queue the run (QUEUED), audited
  Job->>C: the month's attendance and leave
  C-->>Job: records with each system's own codes (年假, 病假, 调休)
  Job->>R: map to the group categories by the approved rules
  R-->>Job: template rows, and exceptions (overlaps, pending, unknown codes)
  alt exceptions are open
    Job-->>API: NEEDS_REVIEW
    HR->>API: settle each exception
  else none
    Job-->>API: SUCCEEDED
  end
  HR->>API: GET the template preview
  API->>FM: the fields the transfer register withholds from this viewer
  API-->>HR: the company template, exactly as it will export
  HR->>API: POST /attendance-leave/runs/:id/export
  API-->>HR: the .xlsx, audited with the fields it left out
